## Generated Skills

Each command group includes a standardized skill package under `skills/<group>/`:

```text
skills/<group>/
├── SKILL.md
├── README.md
├── assets/
│   └── demo-request.json
├── references/
│   ├── command-routing.md
│   ├── workflows.md
│   └── production-checklist.md
└── generation-report.md
```

Generated skills are API scaffolds. `assets/demo-request.json` is valid placeholder JSON and can be used immediately in documented `--file` examples; `generation-report.md` lists source documentation gaps. Before production, fill the MANUAL sections with business intent, routing rules, workflows, safety constraints, and validation evidence.
